<title>UK: TABLE-C. Salvesen year pretax up 10.7 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-C. Salvesen year pretax up 10.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.4		 vs 18.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.15		 vs 8.65</p>
<p> Pretax		     85.9		 vs 77.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   746.3		vs 700.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share were after exceptional items. Before exceptionals they were 19.8p compared with 18.5p last year. Full name of the British distribution group is Christian Salvesen Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
